        "created_at": "2025-08-08T02:55:03.735865+00:00",
        "notes": "[Wraith Renewal](item_bcfde4e9-a18e-4169-bbfc-6439b7a2615a) is my favourite power, for the self sustain. It allows you to be aggressive with your wraith, healing and reloading, while chasing a low health target. This power makes the 1v1 against any character pretty free, and is crucial in the Reaper mirror.\nTake  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) , as these are the 2 stats that the builds uses the most. Take your preferred survival perk.",
