        "notes": "I take  [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) but your choice is very flexible, take what works best for you.\n [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) should be your next pickup. This gives us the reaming weapon life steal we need for survival. Then just take as much weapon damage as possible.\n [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) can be taken as well.\nSell  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) is needed, but keeping them, especially  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318), is good",
