        "notes": "Your just looking for as much weapon damage as possible now, buy whatever perks maximise damage.\nKeep  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and  [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8), but else go crazy.\n [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27),  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b),  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) are strong contenders for high weapon damage.\n [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is strong for its survivability.\n [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is also good, because by this time your ult becomes super weak. It takes a while to kick in, but the buffs it gives are strong.",
